00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:32.690
Okay.

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:09.030
There's no sign of them yet, Thwaites.

00:19:09.650 --> 00:19:13.770
Good. We'll wait. There's no way to escape.

00:19:14.480 --> 00:19:15.440
Here they come, sir.

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:26.770
Just blast a car!

00:19:40.970 --> 00:19:42.090
Give me your gun, Threads.

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:44.010
You're not going to shoot them, sir.

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:45.110
Of course not.

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:50.260
You have shot my foot, sir.

00:19:50.760 --> 00:19:51.380
Threats

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.780
You have shot your foot.

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:56.080
Please, sir, you've got to help us.

00:19:56.180 --> 00:19:56.520
Reg!

00:19:57.700 --> 00:19:59.860
Regs, thank heavens, it's you. Come quickly.

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:00.960
There's been an accident.

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:02.240
Wait a minute, son.

00:20:02.300 --> 00:20:02.800
Oh, but...

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:08.120
Yes, where we were shooting pheasants.

00:20:08.630 --> 00:20:11.730
My full butter didn't realize that feet are out of season.

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:18.110
All right, Threads, you're in good hands.

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:20.500
I took a first aid prize at police school.

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:21.600
Now,

00:20:22.100 --> 00:20:22.880
Which foot is it?

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:24.960
The one with the blood, sir.

00:20:25.210 --> 00:20:25.450
Ah.

00:20:26.170 --> 00:20:26.370
Just.

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:27.420
Testing Ufoshock.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:30.940
Excellent, Reg.

00:20:45.670 --> 00:20:46.430
We'll have to get you to hospital.

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:47.240
immediately.

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:52.820
I shall now proceed to give you a fireman's lift to the car.

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:55.820
I won first prize for fireman's lifts at police school.

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:56.670
Thanks.

00:21:03.640 --> 00:21:04.840
What's its second prize?

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:11.320
Thank you, um, Lord.

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:29.700
they seem to have gone

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:31.360
Who's gone?

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:33.620
Oh, the boy with the woman and the girl.

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:34.700
They seemed upset.

00:21:35.100 --> 00:21:37.720
Oh, probably Picnicus trespassing.

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:39.320
Thought we were shooting at them.

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:40.960
What about my foot?

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:43.360
I'm taking you to the cottage hospital.

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:46.820
I got first prize for driving at police school.

00:21:56.810 --> 00:21:57.230
Thank you.

00:21:58.600 --> 00:21:59.880
You'll be alright now, Mr O'Reilly.

00:22:00.220 --> 00:22:02.260
Yes, and we'll go and settle Lord Mac and his thugs.

00:22:02.970 --> 00:22:04.870
At least I think we can persuade him not to trouble you again.

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:05.660
John.

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:07.060
What is it, Tim?

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:11.040
A call on that number you gave the inspector in case he wants to contact you.

00:22:11.180 --> 00:22:11.900
Weren't it keep?

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:13.310
He said it was important.

00:22:13.630 --> 00:22:15.510
Something about this boy called Michael.

00:22:18.070 --> 00:22:23.730
My enquiries have revealed that the boy, Michael Bell, his mother and sister are indeed missing.

00:22:24.180 --> 00:22:26.040
This is a photograph of the set Marco Bell.

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:29.960
as a

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:31.840
Matter of fact, I have seen him in the flesh.

00:22:32.020 --> 00:22:32.700
What? Where?

00:22:33.130 --> 00:22:35.690
Running out of Lord Dunning's pheasant wood

00:22:35.690 --> 00:22:37.450
just before Thwaites shot himself.

00:22:37.650 --> 00:22:38.430
Shot himself?

00:22:38.550 --> 00:22:40.130
On the toe, a flesh wound.

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:43.890
The hospital commended me on my prompt action and I...

00:22:43.980 --> 00:22:45.080
I drove him back to the hall.

00:22:45.260 --> 00:22:45.940
Where's Michael now?

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:51.200
I don't know. When I'd finished dealing with Thwaites, the boy and the others were gone.

00:22:51.620 --> 00:22:52.600
Thank you.

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:55.750
Inspector, I want you to organise a warrant to search Lord Dunning's estate.

00:22:56.360 --> 00:22:56.540
Thank you.
